## Project Purpose

This project demonstrates how RF fingerprinting and machine learning can be combined with Zero Trust principles to create a device authentication system for wireless environments.

The project is intended for **academic, research, and educational purposes** and can serve as a foundation for further work in wireless security, IoT security, and Zero Trust architectures.
